    "semantic_summary": "ShadowMapPass is a specialized rendering service responsible for generating depth maps from the perspective of a directional light source. It implements IRenderPass, utilizing a dedicated WebGL2Framebuffer and depth texture to capture scene geometry depth. Its core logic involves iterating over shadow-casting objects, setting up the light's MVP matrix, and drawing depth-only geometry while enabling front-face culling to mitigate shadow acne."
